### 16. Merge Paragraph - Gộp Paragraph

**Ví dụ từ `tests/merge_paragraph.py`:**

```python
from docxtpl import DocxTemplate

tpl = DocxTemplate("templates/merge_paragraph_tpl.docx")

context = {"living_in_town": True}

tpl.render(context)
