### Ví dụ 8: Nested Loops trong Template

Tạo document với nested loops (vòng lặp lồng nhau).

**Code Python:**
```python
from docxtpl import DocxTemplate

tpl = DocxTemplate("nested_template.docx")

context = {
    "dishes": [
        {
            "name": "Pizza",
            "ingredients": ["bread", "tomato", "ham", "cheese"],
        },
        {
            "name": "Hamburger",
            "ingredients": ["bread", "chopped steak", "cheese", "sauce"],
        },
        {
            "name": "Apple pie",
            "ingredients": ["flour", "apples", "sugar", "quince jelly"],
        },
    ],
    "authors": [
        {
            "name": "Saint-Exupery",
            "books": [
                {"title": "Le petit prince"},
                {"title": "L'aviateur"},
                {"title": "Vol de nuit"},
            ],
        },
        {
            "name": "Barjavel",
            "books": [
                {"title": "Ravage"},
                {"title": "La nuit des temps"},
                {"title": "Le grand secret"},
            ],
        },
    ],
}

tpl.render(context)
tpl.save("output/nested.docx")
```

**Template Word:**
```
Dishes:
